3. INSTALLATION & ACTIVATION TELEMETRY DISCLOSURE
To enforce domain licensing, provide 1-click update compatibility checks, and
track active installations, the Cloud DRM Client edition automatically transmits
minimal, non-personal installation telemetry to RouteRequestServer upon module
installation, activation, version change, and periodic heartbeats (at most once
every 24 hours). Transmitted data is strictly limited to:
  - Installation web address / domain (app.url) and VA site name;
  - Installed RouteRequest version, build edition, and PHP version;
  - License activation state (activated vs. unactivated) and key prefix.
No pilot personal data (names, emails, IP addresses, or PIREPs) is collected.
Telemetry operates in fail-open mode so temporary network outages do not disrupt
your virtual airline, though an active internet connection is required for
license activation, Cloud DRM features, and update delivery.

